                                                "sense_id": "92f71a59-acc4-3e95-ad05-ccc2a4bde891",
                                                "text": "On the cover of the leaflet advertising the Alpenrose Gasthof in Zirl am Gurgl […] there is a decorative picture of a young woman. […] She has bright flaxen hair and laughing eyes of the same hue as the gentians in the meadow beyond the inn."
                                            }
